<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29436" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mŏlāris</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		mola, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a mill</i> or <i>to grinding, mill-</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			Adj. (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">molaris lapis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					36, 19, 30, § 137</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Isid. 19, 10, 10</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">petrae molares, Grom. Vet. 401, 20: saxum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 212, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lapis molaris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Luc. 17, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">deus,</span>”
				<i>grinding, molar</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. Judic. 15, 19</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mŏlāris</span></b> , is,
			m.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A millstone;</i>
			<b>poet.</b> for <i>any large
			stone</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ramis vastisque molaribus instat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 8, 250</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tac. H. 2, 22</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 3,
			59</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lapis quasi molaris magnus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Apoc. 18, 21</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 82,
			25</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			(Sc. dens.) <i>A grinder, molar</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">interque molares Difficili crescente cibo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					13, 212</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">presso stridere molari,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					160</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">molares superiores (of horses' teeth),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					6, 29, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Pall. 4, 13, 9</span></i>.</div>
